<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3551" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">argentĕus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		argentum. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Of</i> or <i>from silver</i>, <i>made of silver</i> (cf. argentum, I. A.): polubrum,
			Liv. And. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. p. 544, 23</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aquila,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Cat. 1, 9, 24</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">brattea,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 7, 31, § 105</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">phalerae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					5, 5, § 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vasa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					S. 2, 7, 73</span></i>
			; so <i><span class="en">Vulg. Gen. 24, 53</span></i>; <i><span class="en">ib. 2 Tim. 2,
				20</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tac. G. 5</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Triton,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Claud. 21 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dei,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Dan. 5, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">leones,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">ib. 1
					Par. 28, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">simulacra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">ib.
					Apoc. 9, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nummus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					33, 3, 13, § 47</span></i>
			; so <i><span class="en">Vulg. 1 Reg. 2, 36</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">denarius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					19, 3, 15, § 38</span></i>
			; also <i>absol.</i> argenteus, <i><span class="en">Tac. G.
			5</span></i>; so <i><span class="en">Vulg. Gen. 20, 16</span></i>; <i><span class="en">ib. Matt.
				26, 15 al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Metaph. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Adorned with silver</i>, = argentatus: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scaena,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Mur. 19 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acies,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					10, 39</span></i>
			 (cf. a little before: per picta atque aurata scuta; and v.
			argentatus, I.).— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Of a white</i>, <i>silver color</i>,
				<i>silvery</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">niveis argentea pennis Ales,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					2, 536</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">color,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 10, 213</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fons,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 3, 407</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">undae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					4, 8, 15, § 31</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lilia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					5, 4, 25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">anser,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 8, 655</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crinis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 2, 25, 22, § 90 al.</span></i>
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>Of the silver age</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subiit argentea proles, Auro deterior, fulvo
					pretiosior aere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					1, 114</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b> In
			comic style, <i>of</i> or <i>from
			money</i> (cf. argentum, I. B. 2.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">salus,</span>”
				<i>a silver salutation</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Ps. 1, 1, 44 sq.</span></i>
			: amica tua facta est argentea, <i>is turned into
				money</i>, i. e. <i>has been sold</i>,
					<i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 3, 113</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
